IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BACQRY.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT ACCT-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-ACCT-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS AC-ACCT-ID
        FILE STATUS IS WS-ACCT-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD ACCT-FILE.
01 ACCT-REC.
   05 AC-ACCT-ID PIC X(12).
   05 AC-ACCT-CUST-ID PIC X(12).
   05 AC-ACCT-PRODUCT PIC X(04).
   05 AC-ACCT-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 AC-ACCT-STATUS PIC X(02).
   05 AC-ACCT-OPENED PIC 9(08).
   05 AC-ACCT-CLOSED PIC 9(08).
   05 AC-ACCT-VERSION PIC 9(05).
   05 AC-ACCT-HASH PIC X(16).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ACCT-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-ACCT-ST PIC X(02).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-ACCT-ID PIC X(12).
01 LS-OUT.
   05 LS-OUT-ID PIC X(12).
   05 LS-OUT-CUST PIC X(12).
   05 LS-OUT-PRODUCT PIC X(04).
   05 LS-OUT-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 LS-OUT-STATUS PIC X(02).
   05 LS-OUT-OPENED PIC 9(08).
   05 LS-OUT-CLOSED PIC 9(08).
   05 LS-OUT-VERSION PIC 9(05).
   05 LS-OUT-HASH PIC X(16).
   05 LS-OUT-RC PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-ACCT-ID LS-OUT.
    MOVE SPACES TO LS-OUT
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACCT-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/acct.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-ACCT-PATH
    OPEN INPUT ACCT-FILE
    IF WS-ACCT-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LS-OUT-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE LS-ACCT-ID TO AC-ACCT-ID
    READ ACCT-FILE
    IF WS-ACCT-ST = "00"
        MOVE AC-ACCT-ID TO LS-OUT-ID
        MOVE AC-ACCT-CUST-ID TO LS-OUT-CUST
        MOVE AC-ACCT-PRODUCT TO LS-OUT-PRODUCT
        MOVE AC-ACCT-CURRENCY TO LS-OUT-CURRENCY
        MOVE AC-ACCT-STATUS TO LS-OUT-STATUS
        MOVE AC-ACCT-OPENED TO LS-OUT-OPENED
        MOVE AC-ACCT-CLOSED TO LS-OUT-CLOSED
        MOVE AC-ACCT-VERSION TO LS-OUT-VERSION
        MOVE AC-ACCT-HASH TO LS-OUT-HASH
        MOVE "00" TO LS-OUT-RC
    ELSE
        MOVE "23" TO LS-OUT-RC
    END-IF
    CLOSE ACCT-FILE
    GOBACK.
